msgstr "这个开关只负责打开本地代理。"

msgid "Restart the core with the configuration it already has."
msgstr "用现在这份配置重新启动内核。"

msgid "While the core is running, KDE applications use it. Turning the core off withdraws it."
msgstr "内核运行时，KDE 应用程序使用它。内核停止后会撤回。"

msgid "This takes effect only while the core is running and TUN is off."
msgstr "只有内核开着、而且 TUN 关着的时候，这个才会生效。"

