msgstr "用表格打开这些规则。读回来之后还要按应用。"

msgid "No spreadsheet program was found."
msgstr "没有找到表格程序。"

msgid "%1 rules"
msgstr "%1 条规则"

msgid "Select a rule to see its details."
msgstr "选择一条规则查看详情。"

msgid "Editing this profile rule saves your own copy, which a subscription update does not remove."
msgstr "在这里修改会另存成你自己的规则，订阅更新不会清掉它。"

msgid "This rule set comes with the profile. It can be updated, not edited here."
msgstr "这个规则集来自配置。这里只能更新，不能编辑。"

